---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';import Icon from './Icon.astro';import {url} from '../lib/content';
---
<footer class="site-footer"><div class="container footer-grid"><div class="footer-intro"><a class="brand" href={url('/')}><Logo/><span>蜂巢<small>HIVEOS</small></span></a><p>让AI成为一种<br/>可以持续积累的工作方式。</p><small>企业内网中的员工数字分身平台</small></div><div><span class="footer-label">了解蜂巢</span><a href={url('/product/')}>产品与场景</a><a href={url('/architecture/')}>架构与设计</a><a href={url('/library/')}>交流与实践</a></div><div><span class="footer-label">开始使用</span><a href={url('/docs/employee/overview/')}>员工工作台</a><a href={url('/docs/admin/overview/')}>管理员控制台</a><a href={url('/developers/')}>开发者指南</a></div><div><span class="footer-label">继续探索</span><a href="https://www.bluexiii.com/acdl/">ACDL研发方法<Icon name="external" size={14}/></a><a href="https://www.bluexiii.com/">BlueXIII博客<Icon name="external" size={14}/></a><a href="https://github.com/xiiiblue/hive">网站源码<Icon name="external" size={14}/></a></div></div><div class="container footer-bottom"><div class="footer-meta"><span>蜂巢 · 从认识产品，到把它用起来。</span><span>公开文档 · 2026.10 <a href={url('/docs/product/get-started/')}>适用范围</a></span></div><div class="footer-site-info"><span class="site-counter" role="group" aria-label="全站访问统计"><span id="busuanzi_container_site_uv">全站访客 <strong id="busuanzi_value_site_uv"></strong></span><span id="busuanzi_container_site_pv">全站浏览 <strong id="busuanzi_value_site_pv"></strong></span></span><a href="https://beian.miit.gov.cn/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">鲁ICP备18050487号-1</a></div></div></footer>
<script is:inline>
  // 本地预览不向统计服务发送请求；每个页面只加载一次。
  if (location.hostname === 'www.bluexiii.com' && !document.getElementById('hive-visit-counter')) {
    const counter = document.createElement('script');
    counter.id = 'hive-visit-counter';
    counter.async = true;
    counter.referrerPolicy = 'no-referrer-when-downgrade';
    counter.src = 'https://busuanzi.ibruce.info/busuanzi/2.3/busuanzi.pure.mini.js';
    document.head.appendChild(counter);
  }
</script>
